OL,3,APolice assess Palestine Action post by
OL,4,Anational security adviser's wife
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are assessing a social media
OL,7,Fpost by the wife of the government's
OL,8,Fnational security adviser Jonathan
OL,9,FPowell which referenced Palestine
OL,10,FAction, a group labelled a terrorist
OL,11,Forganisation by the Home Office.
OL,13,FSarah Helm wrote on the social media
OL,14,Fsite X: "God help us authors who
OL,15,Fsupport Palestine and Palestine
OL,16,FAction."
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
