OL,3,APolice assess Palestine Action post by
OL,4,Anational security adviser's wife
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was responding to a discussion on
OL,7,FSky News about the author Sally Rooney,
OL,8,Fwhose novels will not be supplied to
OL,9,Fbooksellers in the UK following her
OL,10,Fannouncement that she intends to use
OL,11,Fher royalties to support Palestine
OL,12,FAction.
OL,14,FA No 10 spokeswoman said Helm was "an
OL,15,Findividual who does not represent the
OL,16,Fgovernment in any capacity". The BBC
OL,17,Fhas attempted to contact Helm for
OL,18,Fcomment.
